WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,640
The tailman will no longer pretend to enter the killing state

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,960
Everyone will die then

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,600
killing state

4
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:08,800
Two of us died

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,000
There are now thirty-four more

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,720
If there are six tailmen, then there are twenty-two.

7
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:13,960
Twenty-two more people died

8
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,200
we all have to die

9
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:20,430
If they are allowed to die

10
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:23,390
Even if I fight to the end, I can't escape

11
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:28,460
I have a way to keep you alive but

12
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:30,860
I have a condition

13
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:32,980
what conditions do you have

14
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:35,140
starting from today

15
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,240
All of you have to listen to me

16
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:40,540
Why should I listen to you?

17
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:42,140
You are not a prophet

18
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:43,980
How can you guarantee we can survive?

19
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:48,600
It's just his brain that works

20
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,080
Don't you listen to him and listen to you?

21
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:54,990
Drive them out, you dare?
